sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sending server
    participant M as Elemta MTA
    participant B as Mailbox service
    participant U as Mail app
    S->>M: MAIL FROM, RCPT TO
    Note over M: RCPT checked in LDAP,<br/>unknown users refused
    S->>M: DATA
    Note over M: SPF, DKIM, DMARC, ARC,<br/>antivirus and spam checks
    M-->>S: 250 queued
    M->>B: LMTP over STARTTLS
    Note over B: Sieve: filters,<br/>out-of-office, redirects
    Note over B: metadata to Postgres,<br/>body to file or S3
    B-->>U: IDLE wakes the app
    U->>B: FETCH new message
